<p>When you throw your alchemist bombs, you infuse them with explosive acid that can blind.</p><p>In addition all acid damage you do is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 11%, 16%, 21%, 25%.</acronym></p><p>You cannot have more than one alchemist infusion sustain active at once.</p>